    {
      "blockId": "tour:subsection_text:0549019e6bec216f",
      "field": "subsection.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "95959121673bb4898fb087928dd53c68fb6c5d17be56b4d220366656a2315372",
      "text": "Optional excursions are selected according to your available time and charged separately.\n\nSamba and capoeira evening show: USD 120 per person, show only. Transfers are not included and can be arranged on request.\n\nGuanabara Bay boat tour: shared boat, minimum 2 participants, with guide and transfers, USD 230. The pricing basis for this amount will be confirmed when booking.\n\nSecrets of Old Rio: 4-hour private tour, minimum 2 participants, with an English-speaking guide, USD 170 per person. Food and drinks at Confeitaria Colombo are not included.\n\nHelicopter flight over Rio: price on request; duration 6–13 minutes. The sights visible depend on the flight selected.\n\nBotanical Garden: private tour, minimum 2 participants, with an English-speaking guide, USD 200 per person.\n\nRocinha by jeep: group tour with an English-speaking guide, USD 90 per person; private tour, minimum 2 participants, with an English-speaking guide, USD 170 per person.\n\nHang gliding from Pedra Bonita, landing on Pepino Beach: USD 390 per person. Briefing and flight with an English-speaking instructor; transfers and GoPro recording included.",
